desc: Uppercase the second word
category: motion
par: 5
hint1: Move to the word, then change its case
hint2: gU is the uppercase operator; pair it with the inner-word text object
solution: wgUiw
note: w moves to the next word; gUiw uppercases the inner-word (iw) text object.
